WEBVTT

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:02.156
fjala shalan,

00:02:02.156 --> 00:02:03.950
e cila do te thote ''diçka''

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.798
pikerisht si fjala Anglisht ''something''--

00:02:05.798 --> 00:02:09.084
disa gjera te pa identifikuara, te panjohura.

00:02:09.084 --> 00:02:10.249
Ne gjuhen Arabe,

00:02:10.249 --> 00:02:11.450
ne mund ta shquajm kete fjale

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:13.598
duke shtuar nyjen shquese ''al.''

00:02:13.598 --> 00:02:16.200
Pra, kjo eshte al-shalan--

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.850
gjeja e panjohur.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:21.153
Kjo eshte nje fjale e cila shfaqet qe ne gjenezen e matematikes,

00:02:21.153 --> 00:02:28.353
si ky derivim i provave i shekullit te 10-te.

00:02:28.353 --> 00:02:30.863
Problemi per dijetaret Mesjetare Spanjoll